# Self-check before you reply

Run through this list. Every item has rejected a real document.

- [ ] First character is `{`, last character is `}`.
- [ ] No ``` fence anywhere, and no text outside the JSON.
- [ ] Exactly one top-level key, `crops`, holding an array.
- [ ] Entry count equals `crop_count` from the EXPORT CONTEXT.
- [ ] Entries are in EXPORT CONTEXT order (positional filename matching).
- [ ] Every `id` copied verbatim; the set matches exactly — none extra, none missing.
- [ ] Every `exportedFilename` copied verbatim from the EXPORT CONTEXT,
      including the page stem and the reason suffix; none invented from the
      naming pattern and none rebuilt from the crop JSON's raw `reason`.
- [ ] No filename contains a character outside `a-z`, `0-9`, `_` and the final
      `.png` — a colon or space means a raw reason leaked in unslugified.
- [ ] Every entry has all three keys, and no fourth key.
- [ ] Every `description` is one non-empty sentence, no names, no quoted text.
- [ ] The document parses as JSON.
